 is linearly dependent.\n\n- Statement II is true. Indeed,\n\n$$\n3{t}^{2}-t=0\\cdot 0+(-1)\\cdot t+3\\cdot {t}^{2}+0\\cdot {t}^{3}.\n$$\n\n- Statement III is false. Since the set is not linearly independent, it can't form a basis.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only.\"" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-94847/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "2588e089-4786-5346-b42d-65c2740ae2ab"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-94847"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-94850/selection/95f63c11f99a5015c1f73558576052145e00c1cfbb1718f78cf554be0ab200f9" :answer/id #uuid "1297598f-36e2-5a4d-95d5-df3073c7c8b8" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94850/selection/1f1f2fe9df6485d5cdc7916416b2f79699d874348406e639d5daec02cb2e57e6" :answer/id #uuid "00b44689-ead6-57ed-a171-712662466eb0" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94850/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981" :answer/id #uuid "2a4789aa-5adc-5b78-a7b6-d3812619e2a1" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94850/selection/6a87b4860f595a380edef797b2cc43b24d4896fc51da713259b980588721456c" :answer/id #uuid "5ac8b3d1-6cf3-591b-94bd-cd92aba33f84" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94850/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" :answer/id #uuid "c93fffe8-9e8b-5c6b-bed6-96ca1f532728" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94850/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "ae448059-040f-5e40-af9c-2b6baa5760b8" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-94850/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a92